      "message": "I\u0027m unclear on the rationale for this, because we are no longer using this part. I see from the bug that the original rationale for performing this register reset no longer applies, but it would be nice to have something like a datasheet citation or vendor statement that the right way to come out of LPM is to _not_ do a register reset.\n\nDoes this fix anything in particular?\n\nLGTM, since we aren\u0027t designing with this part.\n\n",
